    <li>Your dependents become eligible for a state's premium assistance program.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>To take advantage of special enrollment rights, you must experience a qualifying event and provide the employer plan with timely notice of the event and your enrollment request.</p>
  <p>To request special enrollment or obtain more information, contact Westmont College, Human Resource Dept. at <span data-field="hr_contact_phone">{{ hr_contact_phone }}</span>.</p>
